# Integrations setup (agent)

Canonical guide: [`docs/integrations-setup.md`](docs/integrations-setup.md).

## When the user asks to connect / configure an office API

1. Follow the **recommended order**: mock → Adliya → Madrid XML → EUIPO → USPTO → IP Australia.
2. Never suggest scraping Madrid Monitor or WIPO Global Brand Database (ToS forbid automation).
3. Put credentials in **Admin → Integrations** (`/admin/integrations/`) or documented env vars — never commit secrets.
4. Madrid bulk import is on **`/admin/registry/`**, not Integrations.
5. Kazpatent has no public REST API — keep unavailable; see `docs/research/kazpatent.md`.
6. After wiring an adapter, remind: apply migration `20260923190000_multi_jurisdiction_hub.sql` if not applied; verify `/account/check/` with jurisdiction toggles (+1 credit each for eu/us/au/kz).
7. **Demo Mode** (admin toggle on Integrations) is global synthetic checks — not the same as per-provider `mock`. Keep OpenAI on `live` while Demo Mode is on. Flag: `app_settings.demo_mode`. Pipeline: `src/lib/check/demo/*` + hook in `runTrademarkCheck`.

## Code map

| Concern | Path |
|---------|------|
| Catalog / modes / secrets shape | `src/lib/integrations/types.ts` |
| Load/save encrypted payload | `src/lib/integrations/store.ts` |
| Storage vault if provider CHECK missing | `src/lib/integrations/secrets-vault.ts` |
| Demo Mode flag | `src/lib/settings/demo-mode.ts` |
| Demo invent + wordmark | `src/lib/check/demo/*` |
| Apply hub migration | `scripts/apply-hub-migration.ts` + SQL Editor |
| Import OpenAI from takleef | `scripts/import-openai-from-takleef.ts` |
| Admin UI + setup steps | `src/components/organisms/IntegrationsPanel.tsx` |
| External search adapters | `src/lib/check/external/*` |
| Madrid importer | `src/lib/registry/madrid-import.ts` |
| Sample dump | `scripts/fixtures/madrid-sample.json` |

## UI copy

Module `steps`, `portalUrl`, `fieldLabels` live in `src/i18n/app-copy.ts` → `adminIntegrations`. Keep uz/ru/en in sync when adding a provider.
